      "label": "P: “Debela serves as the Chief Security Officer at OOX Limited …”",
      "group": "Page",
      "value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Debela serves as the Chief Security Officer at OOX Limited and brings unmatched enthusiasm to the studio. As a proud pug and full-time office mascot, she specializes in security patrols, morale boosting, and extremely advanced snack detection.</span>"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "kind": "html",
      "label": "P: “Her main responsibility is ensuring that no food-related ac…”",
      "group": "Page",
      "value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Her main responsibility is ensuring that no food-related activity goes unnoticed inside the office. While the development team focuses on building games and apps, Debela focuses on monitoring sandwiches, detecting snack movement, and appearing next to anyone who opens food within a five-meter radius.</span>"
    },
